EcoTrace runs, as separate and unmodified programs, third-party components
such as PostgreSQL, Keycloak, APISIX, Hasura, NATS, SeaweedFS, ClamAV,
Trillian and Flowable, and uses third-party libraries from PyPI, Go modules
and npm. None of their source code is included in this repository; each keeps
its own license. The full list, with versions and licenses, is in
docs/licenses.md.
